# ROVEXO Production Polish Execution (ABSOLUTE P0 · LEVEL 8)

## Stop / Start

**STOP** certifying: engines · rules · tests · SSOT · CSS-only “PASS” when real UI is not 100/100.  
**START** certifying: **real components** on the real implementation.

## Order (one component at a time)

COMPONENT → VISIBILITY → FULL WIDTH → RESPONSIVE → ALIGNMENT → SPACING → TEXT → BUTTONS → ICONS → SAFE AREA → ADAPTIVE → PRODUCTION POLISH → **100/100** → only then next component.

## Forbidden

Certifying engines/rules/tests/SSOT while real UI &lt; 100/100.  
Leaving any component at 99/98/97. Only **100/100**.  
Certifying the last component before the first is 100/100.

## Fail → STOP

Not perfectly aligned / centered / responsive / visible / adaptive / polished → **STOP. Fix that component. Do not advance.**

## Production Ready means

Every single component is 100/100 — not the page abstractly, not the engine, not the tests — the **real UI**.

## Mandate

Stop fixing the engine. Start fixing the real UI.  
**UI certification only** — no passwords · no auto-login · no tokens · no secret-bearing actions.
